   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>Denote a type-distinguishing operation to be performed in-place. An instance of this type can be passed to certain constructors of <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"cl_ara_core_Variant_70f719.html\">ara::core::Variant</a> to denote the intention that construction of the contained type shall be done in-place, i.e. without any copying taking place.</p></div>",
